    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 6'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='560' maxwidth='1440' minheight='560' minwidth='1440' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='101607' id='3' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/USER/Documents/death cause tableau/story point 5.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='100000' x='-208' y='-1607' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='55893' id='4' type-v2='text' w='89583' x='4375' y='28571'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>-</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>1.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The Development Gap:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Mortality data acts as a mirror for national development. High-income regions see deaths dominated by lifestyle and age-related diseases (like cancer), while developing regions still face a heavy burden from infectious diseases and preventable accidents.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>-</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>2.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Infrastructure as Healthcare:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>A significant portion of global mortality is tied to non-biological factors. High rates of road accidents and respiratory issues in certain clusters suggest that engineering, urban planning, and environmental policy are just as important as medical doctors.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>- </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>3.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The Shift to Chronic Care:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>As global health improves, the primary challenge is managing long-term conditions. The data shows a massive shift toward non-communicable diseases (NCDs), signaling that future healthcare success depends on early detection and chronic disease management.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>-</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>4.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03bfbf' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Data-Driven Precision:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>There is no universal solution for global health. By analyzing these specific clusters, we can see that resource allocation must be data-driven, that moves from broad aid to targeted interventions based on regional cause-of-death profiles.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
